AutoFAB Robot Hardware: licensing

This repository is multi-licensed. Full texts are in LICENSES/.

1. Hardware designs authored by AutoFAB (everything under cad/ except
   cad/elrobot/) are licensed under CERN-OHL-P-2.0 (LICENSES/CERN-OHL-P-2.0.txt).
2. Documentation (README.md, docs/, bom/, firmware/*.md, images/) is licensed
   under CC-BY-4.0 (LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt).

Third-party material (keeps its original licence):
- cad/elrobot/: unmodified files from ElRobot by NormaCore,
  https://github.com/norma-core/norma-core/tree/main/hardware/elrobot,
  licensed Apache-2.0 (cad/elrobot/LICENSE). The norma-core repository root
  is MIT; the hardware/elrobot folder carries its own Apache-2.0 licence.
- The rail design follows leslider by Pham Tuan Binh,
  https://github.com/pham-tuan-binh/leslider, licensed Apache-2.0
  (LICENSES/third-party/leslider-Apache-2.0.txt). No leslider files are
  copied here; the docs link to them upstream.

